**Lord Sandwich**

This sarcastic remark was made by John Montagu, 4th Earl of Sandwich (commonly known as Lord Sandwich), during a 1775 debate in the British House of Lords responding to the American Olive Branch Petition. As First Lord of the Admiralty, he mocked the Americans' calls for "love and reconciliation" while they armed themselves against Britain.  
\boxed{Lord Sandwich}

